@startuml
title EIVAS System Architecture - Component/Deployment Diagram

' Presentation Layer
package "Presentation Layer" {
    component "Reporting Form Interface [FR-001]" as ReportingForm
    component "Map Visualization Component [AD-003]" as MapVis
}

' Application Layer
package "Application Layer" {
    component "Case Management Module [FR-004 to FR-008]" as CaseMgmt
    component "Itinerary Analysis Module [FR-009, FR-010]" as ItinAnalysis
    component "Outbreak Analysis Module [FR-012 to FR-018]" as OutbreakAnalysis
    component "Authentication/Authorization Module [AD-004]" as AuthModule
    component "Data Validation & Sanitization Layer [NFR-001, DR-008]" as DataValidator
    component "Logging & Monitoring Component [NFR-003]" as Logger
    component "Security Encryption Module [NFR-004, C-004]" as Encryptor
    component "Rate Limiting/Cooldown Mechanism [NFR-005]" as RateLimiter
}

' Algorithm Layer
package "Algorithm Layer" {
    component "Internal Algorithm Processing Module [AD-002]" as AlgModule
}

' Data Layer
package "Data Layer" {
    database "Database Storage System" as Database
    component "Cache Layer [NFR-002]" as Cache
}

' External Systems
cloud "Map Service Provider [AD-003]" as MapService

' Internal Connections
ReportingForm --> DataValidator : Validates input
DataValidator --> CaseMgmt : Passes clean data
CaseMgmt --> Database : CRUD operations (FR-004 to FR-008)
ItinAnalysis --> Database : Queries itinerary data (FR-009)
OutbreakAnalysis --> Database : Retrieves case data for charts (FR-012, FR-013)
AlgModule --> Database : Fetches data for processing (AD-002)
MapVis --> Database : Gets location data (AD-003)
ItinAnalysis --> CaseMgmt : Provides case data
OutbreakAnalysis --> CaseMgmt : Uses managed case data
ItinAnalysis <--> AlgModule : Supplies itinerary for analysis (FR-010)
OutbreakAnalysis --> AlgModule : Requests statistical analysis (FR-014 to FR-018)
ReportingForm --> CaseMgmt : Sends form data (FR-001)
MapVis --> ItinAnalysis : Requests path visualization (FR-009)

' Cross-layer Infrastructure
AuthModule --> CaseMgmt : Secures access
AuthModule --> ItinAnalysis : Secures access
AuthModule --> OutbreakAnalysis : Secures access
Encryptor --> Database : Encrypts stored data
Logger --> CaseMgmt : Logs activity
Logger --> ItinAnalysis : Logs activity
Logger --> OutbreakAnalysis : Logs activity
RateLimiter --> ReportingForm : Controls submission rate
Cache --> Database : Caches frequent queries

' External connections
AlgModule <--> MapService : Delegates map-related computations (AD-003)

@enduml
